        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dino Explore has 5 gamemodes: </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Digsite</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788740/extras/ac0436c3b4040d4f224c809a9daaeef8.avif?t=1762444096\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788740/extras_big/ac0436c3b4040d4f224c809a9daaeef8.webp?t=1762444096 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D indie style gamemode where you're located in a digsite.....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The point of this gamemode is to find facts and dig up dinosaur bones. There comes waves of ores that you can mine. With the ores, you can buy facts and trade them for special items. These special items can allow you to have a higher chance of finding bones or allowing you to mine a certain ore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Club</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788740/extras/ba93407d5c6f09c910da59bdf8af2297.avif?t=1762444096\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788740/extras_big/ba93407d5c6f09c910da59bdf8af2297.webp?t=1762444096 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which dinosaur you want to fight with! There are many maps that give a reward when winning. Unlock new home screens and skins! Every dinosaur has a health and a correct/wrong statistic. When you are in battle, you will get true or false statements. Answering right will often lead to dealing more damage. Win by killing your enemy dinosaur.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Finding Dinosaurs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788740/extras/ea292734339feb8714fbf4ddc7fe127a.avif?t=1762444096\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788740/extras_big/ea292734339feb8714fbf4ddc7fe127a.webp?t=1762444096 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This gamemode unlocks &quot;Comparison Room&quot; and &quot;Question Room&quot;. (meaning you must complete this gamemode to get access to those gamemodes)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Dinosaurs is exactly what it sounds like. You're supposed to find dinosaurs. You move around in 2D world and look for dinosaurs. When you have found a dinosaur, you can learn some facts about it. There are a total of 28 dinosaurs and you need to find all of them to complete this gamemode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a dinosaur is found , you can find it in &quot;Library&quot;. Library is where you can reset the whole game (all gamemodes) and see what dinosaurs you have left to find</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Question Room</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788740/extras/a02f57f7013b6dfd6e6d46260caaa08f.avif?t=1762444096\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788740/extras_big/a02f57f7013b6dfd6e6d46260caaa08f.webp?t=1762444096 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a dinosaur quiz game. You have 55 different questions, and most of them , depending on how much you know about dinosaurs are challenging. This gamemode are for those who want to challenge themself and learn about dinosaurs. Everytime you answer correctly, you gain 1 answer point. Everytime you answer wrongly, you lose one point (unless you're at 0). When you have gotten a certain amount of points, dinosaurs and terrain will show up on your screen. You can tap on these objects and they will make a sound!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Comparison Room</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788740/extras/27fb1d12f7129129c58949aa1d89a043.avif?t=1762444096\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788740/extras_big/27fb1d12f7129129c58949aa1d89a043.webp?t=1762444096 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This gamemode is all about comparing. Compare dinosaurs with a man, woman, hyena, house and a truck. Both dinosaurs and compare objects are of realistic size.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is for people that want to know how big dinosaurs truly are. Some might be smaller than you expected and some might be bigger than you expected!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dino Explore has 5 gamemodes: </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Digsite</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788740/extras/ac0436c3b4040d4f224c809a9daaeef8.avif?t=1762444096\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788740/extras_big/ac0436c3b4040d4f224c809a9daaeef8.webp?t=1762444096 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D indie style gamemode where you're located in a digsite.....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The point of this gamemode is to find facts and dig up dinosaur bones. There comes waves of ores that you can mine. With the ores, you can buy facts and trade them for special items. These special items can allow you to have a higher chance of finding bones or allowing you to mine a certain ore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Club</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788740/extras/ba93407d5c6f09c910da59bdf8af2297.avif?t=1762444096\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788740/extras_big/ba93407d5c6f09c910da59bdf8af2297.webp?t=1762444096 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which dinosaur you want to fight with! There are many maps that give a reward when winning. Unlock new home screens and skins! Every dinosaur has a health and a correct/wrong statistic. When you are in battle, you will get true or false statements. Answering right will often lead to dealing more damage. Win by killing your enemy dinosaur.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Finding Dinosaurs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788740/extras/ea292734339feb8714fbf4ddc7fe127a.avif?t=1762444096\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788740/extras_big/ea292734339feb8714fbf4ddc7fe127a.webp?t=1762444096 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This gamemode unlocks &quot;Comparison Room&quot; and &quot;Question Room&quot;. (meaning you must complete this gamemode to get access to those gamemodes)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Dinosaurs is exactly what it sounds like. You're supposed to find dinosaurs. You move around in 2D world and look for dinosaurs. When you have found a dinosaur, you can learn some facts about it. There are a total of 28 dinosaurs and you need to find all of them to complete this gamemode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a dinosaur is found , you can find it in &quot;Library&quot;. Library is where you can reset the whole game (all gamemodes) and see what dinosaurs you have left to find</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Question Room</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788740/extras/a02f57f7013b6dfd6e6d46260caaa08f.avif?t=1762444096\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788740/extras_big/a02f57f7013b6dfd6e6d46260caaa08f.webp?t=1762444096 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a dinosaur quiz game. You have 55 different questions, and most of them , depending on how much you know about dinosaurs are challenging. This gamemode are for those who want to challenge themself and learn about dinosaurs. Everytime you answer correctly, you gain 1 answer point. Everytime you answer wrongly, you lose one point (unless you're at 0). When you have gotten a certain amount of points, dinosaurs and terrain will show up on your screen. You can tap on these objects and they will make a sound!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Comparison Room</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788740/extras/27fb1d12f7129129c58949aa1d89a043.avif?t=1762444096\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788740/extras_big/27fb1d12f7129129c58949aa1d89a043.webp?t=1762444096 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This gamemode is all about comparing. Compare dinosaurs with a man, woman, hyena, house and a truck. Both dinosaurs and compare objects are of realistic size.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is for people that want to know how big dinosaurs truly are. Some might be smaller than you expected and some might be bigger than you expected!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Dino Explore is a fun way to learn more about dinosaurs! Do you want to dig up bones? Or maybe you want to find dinosaurs in a 2d world? Are you interested in a dinosaur quiz, challenging your knowledge about dinosaurs or .... maybe you just want to compare sizes. All of this is in the game!",
